  "instruction": "Prepare a local structured status-request draft and run summary for the sole Cascade matter under the default recency filter. Retrieve the retained lead address and scope, qualify stale deadlines and conflicting cost figures, and leave unavailable signer/style/authorization unknown. Do not create Gmail drafts or send anything.",
